      "title": "Two clocks, deliberately",
      "items": [
        "The pipe is fast and shallow: names and health, no identity",
        "The log is slower and exact: it says who did what to whom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Overlays are dumb on purpose",
      "items": [
        "No overlay holds state; each polls the agent and paints",
        "One tracker fix corrects every window that shows it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Locked overlays are click-through",
      "items": [
        "Clicks fall through to EverQuest by default",
        "Every control does a hover handshake to take the click back"
      ]
